---
<Layout title="Ongoing Employment Legal Support for Companies | Barcelona" description="Ongoing employment law support for companies in Barcelona and Spain. A recurring legal channel for employment questions, sensitive decisions and preventive review.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Recurring support" title="A recurring legal channel for companies that handle employment decisions throughout the year." description="A defined channel for recurring employment questions can make it easier to review decisions consistently before they become disputes." primaryLabel="Discuss recurring support" primaryHref="/en/contact" secondaryLabel="Company services" secondaryHref="/en/business" />
<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Useful when</span><h2>The same kind of legal question keeps returning.</h2></div><div class="prose"><ul><li>Employment decisions arise regularly across the year.</li><li>Managers need a consistent point of legal review.</li><li>Contracts, disciplinary measures or exits need recurring attention.</li><li>The company wants preventive review before a decision is communicated.</li></ul><p>The appropriate scope should be defined with the company according to its activity, workforce and recurring needs.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-paper"><div class="container cards"><div class="card"><div><span class="card-kicker">Continuity</span><h3>Consistent legal framework</h3><p>Keep recurring employment questions within the same legal and documentary context.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div><span class="card-kicker">Prevention</span><h3>Review before action</h3><p>Identify sensitive points before a manager sends the letter or implements the decision.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div><span class="card-kicker">Clarity</span><h3>Known next steps</h3><p>Turn recurring questions into a clearer internal route for legal review.</p></div></div></div></section>
<CTA title="Would a recurring employment channel help?" text="Tell us the type of decisions and questions your company handles most often." label="Contact the firm" />
</Layout>
